###Block: Race trait abilities
Race Traits ~ Axani	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=Axani Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Axani ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Axani Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.3	DESC:Axani are native outsiders descended from inhabitants of the planes of law.
Calm Emotions	KEY:Axani ~ Calm Emotions	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Axani Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.3	DESC:Once per day, an axani can use calm emotions as a spell-like ability, as a cleric of its character level.
Racial Skills	KEY:Axani ~ Racial Skills	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Axani Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.3	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Diplomacy and Spot checks.

###Block: Cansin
Race Traits ~ Cansin	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=Cansin Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Cansin ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cansin Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.3	DESC:Cansin are native outsiders, most often descended from inhabitants of Limbo.
Entropic Shield	KEY:Cansin ~ Entropic Shield	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cansin Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.3	DESC:Once per day, a cansin can use entropic shield as a spell-like ability, as a cleric of its character level.
Racial Skills	KEY:Cansin ~ Racial Skills	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Cansin Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.3	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Bluff and Search checks.

###Block: Dust Para-Genasi
Race Traits ~ Dust Para-Genasi	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=DustParaGenasi Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Dust Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DustParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:Dust Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Dust Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DustParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against dust spells and effects (such as dust of dryness or a dust mephit's breath). The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
Dust Cloud	KEY:Dust Para-Genasi ~ Dust Cloud	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DustParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:Once per day (Su), create a 20-foot-radius cloud of dust centered on yourself for 5 minutes. Creatures more than 5 feet apart in the cloud have concealment (20%% miss chance). All other creatures in the cloud must succeed on a Fortitude save (DC 10 + 1/2 level + Cha modifier) or cough, taking -2 on attacks and skill checks until they leave the cloud.
Clerical Focus	KEY:Dust Para-Genasi ~ Clerical Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DustParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:A cleric of this race must worship a deity granting the Air or Earth domain, and must select one of those domains.
Breathless	KEY:Dust Para-Genasi ~ Breathless	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DustParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:(Ex) Does not breathe; immune to drowning, suffocation, and inhaled attacks (such as some poisons).

###Block: Ice Para-Genasi
Race Traits ~ Ice Para-Genasi	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=IceParaGenasi Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Ice Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:IceParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:Ice Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Ice Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:IceParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against cold effects. The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
Chill Metal	KEY:Ice Para-Genasi ~ Chill Metal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:IceParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:Once per day, use chill metal as a spell-like ability, as a druid of your character level.
Clerical Focus	KEY:Ice Para-Genasi ~ Clerical Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:IceParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.4	DESC:A cleric of this race must worship a deity granting the Air, Cold, or Water domain, and must select one of those domains.

