Disguise Self	KEY:Gruwaar ~ Disguise Self	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gruwaar Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.17	DESC:Once per day, disguise self as a spell-like ability (caster level 1st).

