Open Minded	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Open Minded	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:One extra feat at 1st level. Exiled dwarves lose darkvision, stonecunning, stability, and the racial bonuses against poison and spells.
Weapon Familiarity	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Weapon Familiarity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Dwarven waraxes and dwarven urgroshes are martial weapons.
Vengeance	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Vengeance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+2 racial bonus on attack and damage rolls against orcs and goblinoids.
Giant Fighter	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Giant Fighter	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+6 dodge bonus to Armor Class against monsters of the giant type.
Stone and Metal Lore	KEY:Exiled Dwarf ~ Stone and Metal Lore	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ExiledDwarf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Appraise and Craft checks related to stone or metal items.

###Block: Declining Elf
