Weapon Proficiency	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Weapon Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Proficient with longsword, rapier, longbow, and shortbow (including composite bows).
Weapon Focus	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Weapon Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Gains Weapon Focus with one melee weapon (longsword or rapier) and one ranged weapon (longbow or shortbow).
Keen Senses	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Keen Senses	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:+2 racial bonus on Listen, Search, and Spot checks; can notice secret doors by passing within 5 feet.
Faded Heritage	KEY:Declining Elf ~ Faded Heritage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DecliningElf Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.37	DESC:Declining elves lose sleep immunity, the save bonus against enchantments, and trance (must sleep 8 hours). They age as half-elves.

###Block: Techno Gnome
