Weapon Familiarity	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Weapon Familiarity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:Gnome hooked hammers are martial weapons.
Racial Combat Training	KEY:Techno Gnome ~ Racial Combat Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:TechnoGnome Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+1 racial bonus on attack rolls against kobolds and goblinoids; +4 dodge bonus to AC against giants.
